---
// components/Methodology.astro
---

<section id="processus" class="py-24 bg-surface-alt relative border-y border-gray-200/50">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-20 reveal">
      <h2 class="font-display text-section text-deep-tech mb-6">
        L'objectif est le résultat,<br/>pas la théorie.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-text-secondary">
        Une méthode en 3 étapes claires, pour passer de la surcharge administrative à un système sous contrôle.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Timeline / Steps -->
    <div class="relative max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <!-- Connecting line for desktop -->
      <div class="hidden md:block absolute left-1/2 top-0 bottom-0 w-1 bg-gradient-to-b from-brand-orange via-accent-blue to-accent-light transform -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full opacity-20"></div>

      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center mb-16 reveal">
        <div class="md:w-1/2 md:pr-12 text-center md:text-right mb-6 md:mb-0">
          <div class="inline-block p-2 bg-brand-orange/10 rounded-lg text-brand-orange text-sm font-bold mb-3">Étape 1</div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-deep-tech mb-3">Diagnostic</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-text-secondary md:ml-auto md:mr-0 inline-block text-left md:text-right">
            <li>✓ Audit gratuit stratégique</li>
            <li>✓ Analyse de vos outils (Gmail, Notion, etc.)</li>
            <li>✓ Identification précise des pertes de temps</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        
        <div class="absolute left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 hidden md:flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-white border-4 border-brand-orange z-10 shadow-md">
          <span class="text-brand-orange font-bold">1</span>
        </div>
        
        <div class="md:w-1/2 md:pl-12">
          <!-- Visual placeholder/illustration -->
          <div class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 flex items-center justify-center h-32 text-4xl">
            🔍
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row-reverse items-center mb-16 reveal delay-100">
        <div class="md:w-1/2 md:pl-12 text-center md:text-left mb-6 md:mb-0">
          <div class="inline-block p-2 bg-accent-blue/10 rounded-lg text-accent-blue text-sm font-bold mb-3">Étape 2</div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-deep-tech mb-3">Plan d'action</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-text-secondary inline-block text-left">
            <li>✓ Recommandations concrètes</li>
            <li>✓ Priorisation des automatisations ROIstes</li>
            <li>✓ Livrable de synthèse clair et chiffré</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        
        <div class="absolute left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 hidden md:flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-white border-4 border-accent-blue z-10 shadow-md">
          <span class="text-accent-blue font-bold">2</span>
        </div>
        
        <div class="md:w-1/2 md:pr-12">
          <div class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 flex items-center justify-center h-32 text-4xl">
            📋
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center reveal delay-200">
        <div class="md:w-1/2 md:pr-12 text-center md:text-right mb-6 md:mb-0">
          <div class="inline-block p-2 bg-green-500/10 rounded-lg text-green-600 text-sm font-bold mb-3">Étape 3</div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-deep-tech mb-3">Mise en œuvre</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-text-secondary md:ml-auto md:mr-0 inline-block text-left md:text-right">
            <li>✓ Setup technique sur mesure</li>
            <li>✓ Déploiement silencieux</li>
            <li>✓ Formation & Reporting (Suivi du ROI)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        
        <div class="absolute left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 hidden md:flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-white border-4 border-green-500 z-10 shadow-md">
          <span class="text-green-500 font-bold">3</span>
        </div>
        
        <div class="md:w-1/2 md:pl-12">
          <div class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 flex items-center justify-center h-32 text-4xl">
            🚀
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
